WEBVTT

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.617
Woman: Mama.
Baby: Mama.

00:13:00.641 --> 00:13:02.773
Woman: Misses.
Baby: Misses.

00:13:02.797 --> 00:13:04.111
Woman: All.
Baby: All.

00:13:04.135 --> 00:13:05.338
Woman: Of.
Baby: Of.

00:13:05.362 --> 00:13:07.158
Woman: You.
Baby: You.

00:13:07.182 --> 00:13:09.435
Man: I love asking folks
to give me a quick tour

00:13:09.459 --> 00:13:10.903
of their makeshift home office

00:13:10.927 --> 00:13:12.447
if they're comfortable with it.

00:13:12.471 --> 00:13:14.495
I've found it often
leads to a conversation

00:13:14.519 --> 00:13:16.456
about hobbies or life outside of work,

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.753
which has been really, really cool
for building closer relationships

00:13:19.777 --> 00:13:22.176
and kind of humanizing
the other folks on the team.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.448
Woman: OK, one more thing.

00:13:23.472 --> 00:13:25.715
If you're happy and you
know it shout "hooray"!

00:13:25.739 --> 00:13:27.536
Baby: Hooray!

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:28.710
Woman: All right!